We have, $\mathbf{p}=\hat{\mathbf{i}}+\hat{\mathbf{j}}, \mathbf{q}=4 \hat{\mathbf{k}}-\hat{\mathbf{j}}$ and $\mathbf{r}=\hat{\mathbf{i}}+\hat{\mathbf{k}}\begin{aligned}
