Now, $\mathbf{a} \cdot(\mathbf{a}+\mathbf{b})=|\mathbf{a}||\mathbf{a}+\mathbf{b}| \cos x$ where $x$ is angle between $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{a}+\mathbf{b}$.
